        Head Length: 0.07999999821186066
        Head Radius: 0.03999999910593033
        Shaft Length: 0.25
        Shaft Radius: 0.019999999552965164
        Value: Arrow
      Topic:
        Depth: 5
        Durability Policy: Volatile
        Filter size: 10
